{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 的 S13「可就算听到了，越喜欢跟他待着，越觉得时间过得快」因果衔接不够清楚，不如 X 直接说明没人能保证永远，人物的担忧更容易理解。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的加亮词能让我快速抓住每段叙事的关键转折，不必逐字读完；感受文字按音乐出现，也让我能把听到的变化和人物当下的心理联系起来。尤其是水面、船身、光线、呼吸等意象反复呼应，让整段经历有连续的感官线索，细腻程度也明显胜过 X。X 的优势是叙事因果交代得更完整、更稳，尤其人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕失去，读起来更直接；但综合实际观看体验，我更愿意选 Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e84b1217-c0cf-4b32-843c-724381bd3c6e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T022224206779Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:23:50.659319+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8e60dcb51fcfbc97b3f86840b53835c94f4d10f3b3896b737663cd11bd3e4b53", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg